#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:10
msgid "KolourPaint"
msgstr "ColorPaint इति"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:11
msgid "Paint Program"
msgstr "पेंट प्रोग्राम"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:13
msgid ""
"KolourPaint is a simple painting program to quickly create raster images. It "
"is useful as a touch-up tool and simple image editing tasks."
msgstr ""
"KolourPaint इति सरलः चित्रकलाकार्यक्रमः शीघ्रं रास्टरप्रतिमानां निर्माणार्थं भवति । "
"स्पर्श-उपकरणरूपेण सरल-प्रतिबिम्ब-सम्पादन-कार्यरूपेण च उपयोगी भवति ।"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:17
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "गुणाः:"

